---
import Public from "../layouts/Public.astro";
---

<Public title="Docs" description="Integrate flamegraph-sdk with your PI agent in a few steps.">
  <style>
    .wrap {
      max-width: 920px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      margin-top: 0.2rem;
    }

    .head {
      border: 1px solid var(--pub-border);
      border-radius: 1rem;
      background: var(--pub-surface);
      padding: 1.1rem;
      margin-bottom: 0.85rem;
    }

    .head h1 {
      margin: 0;
      font-family: "Bricolage Grotesque", sans-serif;
      font-size: clamp(1.45rem, 5vw, 2.2rem);
      letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    }

    .head p {
      margin: 0.55rem 0 0;
      color: var(--pub-text-subtle);
      line-height: 1.65;
      max-width: 64ch;
    }

    .doc-section {
      border: 1px solid var(--pub-border);
      border-radius: 0.95rem;
      background: var(--pub-surface);
      padding: 1rem;
      margin-bottom: 0.72rem;
    }

    .doc-section h2 {
      margin: 0;
      font-family: "Bricolage Grotesque", sans-serif;
      font-size: 1.18rem;
    }

    .doc-section p {
      margin: 0.5rem 0 0;
      color: var(--pub-text-subtle);
      line-height: 1.6;
      font-size: 0.92rem;
    }

    .code {
      margin-top: 0.65rem;
      border: 1px solid var(--pub-border);
      border-radius: 0.75rem;
      background: #0a1224;
      overflow: hidden;
    }

    .code-head {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: center;
      padding: 0.5rem 0.7rem;
      border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(148, 163, 184, 0.2);
      color: #b6c8ec;
      font-size: 0.72rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      letter-spacing: 0.05em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
    }

    .copy-btn {
      border: 1px solid rgba(148, 163, 184, 0.3);
      border-radius: 0.45rem;
      background: transparent;
      color: #d4e1fb;
      font-size: 0.72rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      padding: 0.2rem 0.48rem;
      cursor: pointer;
    }

    .copy-btn:hover {
      border-color: #f97316;
      color: #f97316;
    }

    .code pre {
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0.8rem;
      overflow: auto;
      font-family: "JetBrains Mono", monospace;
      color: #d8e5ff;
      font-size: 0.84rem;
      line-height: 1.65;
    }

    .list {
      margin: 0.62rem 0 0;
      padding: 0;
      list-style: none;
      display: grid;
      gap: 0.45rem;
    }

    .list li {
      border: 1px solid var(--pub-border);
      border-radius: 0.65rem;
      background: var(--pub-surface-2);
      padding: 0.5rem 0.6rem;
      color: var(--pub-text-subtle);
      font-size: 0.85rem;
    }

    .list strong {
      color: var(--pub-text);
    }
  </style>

  <div class="wrap">
    <section class="head">
      <h1>Documentation</h1>
      <p>Use `flamegraph-sdk` with your PI agent and stream telemetry to your dashboard with minimal setup.</p>
    </section>

    <section class="doc-section">
      <h2>1. Install</h2>
      <p>Install the package from npm:</p>
      <div class="code">
        <div class="code-head">
          <span>shell</span>
          <button class="copy-btn" data-copy="npm install flamegraph-sdk">Copy</button>
        </div>
        <pre>npm install flamegraph-sdk</pre>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="doc-section">
      <h2>2. Instrument your agent</h2>
      <p>Wrap your agent once, then all session events flow automatically.</p>
      <div class="code">
        <div class="code-head">
          <span>agent.ts</span>
          <button class="copy-btn" data-copy-id="quickstart-code">Copy</button>
        </div>
        <pre id="quickstart-code">{`import { instrumentAgent, LocalCollector } from "flamegraph-sdk";

const collector = new LocalCollector({
  serverUrl: process.env.FLAMEGRAPH_URL,
  apiKey: process.env.FLAMEGRAPH_API_KEY,
});

instrumentAgent(agent, { collector });`}</pre>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="doc-section">
      <h2>3. Key options</h2>
      <ul class="list">
        <li><strong>serverUrl:</strong> Ingest endpoint for your collector API.</li>
        <li><strong>apiKey:</strong> Workspace API key from Settings.</li>
        <li><strong>autoFlushIntervalMs:</strong> Optional client-side flush interval.</li>
        <li><strong>metadata:</strong> Attach feature, engineer, or project context.</li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section class="doc-section">
      <h2>4. Recommended workflow</h2>
      <ul class="list">
        <li>Generate an API key in dashboard Settings.</li>
        <li>Save it in environment variables, never hardcode in source.</li>
        <li>Run an agent session and open the Sessions page.</li>
        <li>Inspect flamegraph, waste report, and budget violations.</li>
      </ul>
    </section>
  </div>

  <script>
    document.querySelectorAll(".copy-btn").forEach((btn) => {
      btn.addEventListener("click", async () => {
        const inlineText = btn.getAttribute("data-copy");
        const sourceId = btn.getAttribute("data-copy-id");
        const targetEl = sourceId ? document.getElementById(sourceId) : null;
        const text = inlineText || targetEl?.innerText || "";
        if (!text) return;

        try {
          await navigator.clipboard.writeText(text);
          const initial = btn.textContent;
          btn.textContent = "Copied";
          setTimeout(() => {
            btn.textContent = initial;
          }, 1400);
        } catch {
          btn.textContent = "Failed";
          setTimeout(() => {
            btn.textContent = "Copy";
          }, 1400);
        }
      });
    });
  </script>
</Public>
